      "label": "two men walking and laughing together",
      "description": "The scene depicts two men walking side by side on a street, both smiling and appearing to enjoy each other's company. The man on the right has his arm around the shoulder of the man on the left, indicating camaraderie. The background shows an urban street with a parked truck and utility poles, suggesting a casual, everyday setting. The overall mood is lighthearted and friendly.",
